" "},{"type":"text","text":"directly, and do not create your own subclasses of this class. The shape"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"classes correspond to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Geometry"},{"type":"text","text":" object"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"types in the GeoJSON standard, but some have nonstandard names for backwards"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"compatibility."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Although you do not create instances of this class directly, you can use its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape\/shapeWithData:encoding:error:","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" factory method to create one of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"concrete subclasses of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" noted above from GeoJSON data. To access a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shape’s attributes, use the corresponding "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" class instead."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can add shapes to the map by adding them to an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource"},{"type":"text","text":" object."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Configure the appearance of an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource"},{"type":"text","text":"’s or "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource"},{"type":"text","text":"’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shapes collectively using a concrete instance of "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Alternatively, you can add some kinds of shapes directly to a map view as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"annotations or overlays."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can filter the features in a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" or vary their layout or"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"paint attributes based on the features’ geographies. Pass an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference"},{"text":" into an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSPredicate","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with the format "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SELF IN %@"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"%@ CONTAINS SELF","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and set the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer\/predicate"},{"type":"text","text":" property to that predicate, or set a layout or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"paint attribute to a similarly formatted "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSExpression"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNShapeSource"}],"type":"topic","title":"MLNShapeSource","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc: